<P class=MsoNormal style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 29.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: #474747; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm'>1.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: #474747; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm'>初审：幼儿园、中小学及市属教育行政部门等由各市教育科学规划办负责初审；各有关高校由科研处负责初审。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #474747; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
